  "details": "Version: 932\nSDK: VRCSDK2-2020.05.12.10.37_Public and VRCSDK3-UDON-2020.05.12.10.33_Public\nI noticed this issue quite a few versions ago in my world that has an interactive button inside a larger vrc trigger volume. Again today I noticed that the same thing stops you interacting with the photo or stream camera buttons.\nBy placing any VRC_trigger inside another VRC_trigger you can no longer interact using OnInteract in vr. This is more noticeable at closer distances. Normal unity triggers and colliders act as expected, only once it becomes a vrc trigger does it cause issues. \nI've provided the following example worlds and their respective example video\nSDK2 Examples\n-World: wrld_1bce4253-a57d-4a99-89e4-770f342b3a06\n-Video: https://youtu.be/DKPPLIj-H00 (Youtube, 1m12s)\nSDK3 Examples\n-World: wrld_4ae386da-8eae-4408-9870-2c02268c087f\n-Video: https://youtu.be/DvkjDn7BVOg (Youtube, 1m33s)",
